    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi usiku uho mfalume wakala na chilahulwe. Achilagiza chitabu cha kumbukumbu ya mambo garigohendeka chirehwe. Phahi charehwa na chichisomwa mbereze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiriphosomwa, waona kukala siku za nyuma, atumishi airi ariotulwa a mfalume, ambao kala ni Bigithana na Tereshi apanga njama ya kumuolaga mfalume Ahasuero ela Modekai achiasema. Atu hano airi kala ni a mwengao kahi ya hara ariokala achirinda ryango ra mfalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphosikira hivyo mfalume achiauza hinyo atumishie achiamba, “Ni chitu chani cha mana na ishima arichohenderwa Modekai kpwa higo arigohenda?” Na hinyo ahumwa achimuamba kukala kayahenderwa rorosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalume achiuza, “Ni ani ariye hipho muhalani?” Wakati hinyo Hamani kala akedza pho muhalani kondze ya nyumba ya mfalume ili abishe naye kuhusu kumnyonga Modekai dzulu ya hinyo muhi ariokala akautengeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo hinyo ahumwa achimuamba kukala Hamani aimire hiko muhalani. Mfalume achiamba, “Muambireni ainjire mara mwenga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamani ariphoinjira mfalume achimuamba, “Ni dzambo rani riwezaro kuhenderwa mutu ambaye mfalume analonda kumtuza?” Hipho Hamani achigomba chimoyo-moyo achiamba, “Ni ani ambaye mfalume analonda kumtuza isiphokala mimi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Hamani achimjibu mfalume achimuamba, “Mutu ambaye mfalume analonda kumtuza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni areherwe nguwo za chifalume ambazo hiye mfalume mwenye nkuzivwala na farasi ambaye hiye mfalume mwenye nkuphirika. Hiye farasi ni akale akavwikpwa chirauni cha chifalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hizo nguwo na farasi vichirehwa navihewe chilongozi mmwenga wa chifalume. Amuhale hiye mutu ambaye mfalume akamendza kumtuza, amvwike hizo nguwo na ampandize dzulu ya hiye farasi. Achimala hivyo amzunguluse himo mudzini kuno anakota kululu na kuamba, ‘Hivi ndivyo ahenderwavyo mutu ambaye mfalume akamendza kumtuza.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalume achimuamba Hamani, “Haya upesi kahale hizo nguwo na hiye farasi, ukamuhendere Modekai yuya Myahudi asagalaye kpwenye ryango ra nyumba ya mfalume, vyosi uchivyoamba, phasiphunguke hata neno mwenga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Hamani achendahala nguwo na farasi achedzamvwika Modekai, halafu achimpandiza dzulu ya hiye farasi achimzungulusa mo mudzini kuno anakota kululu na kuamba, “Hivi ndivyo ahenderwavyo mutu ambaye mfalume analonda kumtuza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Hamani wamzungulusa Modekai hata achimala. Chisha Modekai achiuya katika ryango ra nyumba ya mfalume ela Hamani achiwania kuphiya kpwakpwe kaya na sonono nyinji kuno akadziziba uso kpwa waibu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphofika kaya, Hamani wamsemurira mchewe na asenae gosi garigokala gakamphaha. Atu a Hamani enye achili na Zereshi achimuamba, “Ichikala ye Modekai ambaye ukaandza kare kugbwa mbereze ni Myahudi, phahi kundamturya bii mana kugbwa undagbwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabila taadzangbwemala kugomba, ahumwa a mfalume otulwa nao poo, achiinjira kare maruru achimuhala Hamani achimphirika kpwenye sharee iriyoandaliwa ni Esta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
